{"ref":"character:blackmore","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Alucard.gif","w":40,"h":34}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Ode to Castlevania)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Blackmore is a secret playable character from the Ode to Castlevania DLC of Vampire Survivors. His starting weapon is ",{"i":"Sprite-Summon_Spirit.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:summon-spirit"}," ",{"t":"Summon Spirit","r":"weapon:summon-spirit"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["31 October 2024 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["TP_BLACKMORE"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Controller","cells":[["TP_Blackmore_Character"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Summon_Spirit.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:summon-spirit"}," ",{"t":"Summon Spirit","r":"weapon:summon-spirit"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Let no Shadow fall on the founder of Ecclesia."]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 16,650"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["Yes"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[["No"]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Move Speed","cells":[["+40%"]]},{"label":"Duration","cells":[["+40%"]]},{"label":"Greed","cells":[["+100%"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":21,"h":21,"a":"A sprite icon representing Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane linking to Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," \"Let no Shadow fall on the founder of Ecclesia.\"\nFull unlock method hidden. Click \"Show Details\" to unhide."]},{"k":"p","c":["After unlocking the ",{"i":"Sprite-Scorpion_Gate.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:scorpion-gate"}," ",{"t":"Scorpion Gate","r":"relic:scorpion-gate"}," in the ",{"t":"Ode to Castlevania","r":"stage:ode-to-castlevania-stage"}," stage, Blackmore will appear as a boss enemy from his summoning circle, located in the hidden section of the Library (inside the top part of the middle building). The room where his summoning circle is located in also contains an ",{"i":"Sprite-Arma_Dio.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:arma-dio"}," ",{"t":"Arma Dio","r":"weapon:arma-dio"},". Then, defeat him while playing as ",{"i":"Sprite-Barlowe.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:barlowe"}," ",{"t":"Barlowe","r":"character:barlowe"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once unlocked, Blackmore can be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 16,650, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Blackmore can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"bizarreshadeadventure\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Blackmore starts with +40% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},", +40% ",{"i":"Sprite-Duration.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:duration"}," ",{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"},", and +100% ",{"i":"Sprite-Greed.png","w":24,"h":20,"r":"powerup:greed"}," ",{"t":"Greed","r":"powerup:greed"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["He can choose a per-level bonus after defeating a set amount of enemies up to 5 times: 1% ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Area.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:area"}," ",{"t":"Area","r":"powerup:area"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:speed"}," ",{"t":"Speed","r":"powerup:speed"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Duration.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:duration"}," ",{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Recovery.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"}," (0.01), ",{"i":"Sprite-Growth.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:growth"}," ",{"t":"Growth","r":"powerup:growth"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Luck.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Greed.png","w":24,"h":20,"r":"powerup:greed"}," ",{"t":"Greed","r":"powerup:greed"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Curse.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:curse"}," ",{"t":"Curse","r":"powerup:curse"},", or ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},". Bonus selection is available at 1000, 5000, 9000, 13000, and 17000 kills."]},{"k":"p","c":["Blackmore starts with an extra ",{"i":"Sprite-Chaos_in_the_Dark_Night_(V).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:chaos-in-the-dark-night-v"}," ",{"t":"Chaos in the Dark Night (V)","r":"arcana:chaos-in-the-dark-night-v"}," Arcana. Blackmore is also able to gain up to five Arcana."]},{"k":"p","c":["He can find special Ode to Castlevania pickups from light sources."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Blackmore's 5 per-level bonuses make him, along with ",{"i":"Sprite-Scientist_Mina.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:scientist-mina"}," ",{"t":"Scientist","r":"character:scientist-mina"},", the highest scaling character for nine of the ten stats he can select (the exception being Recovery, where they are outclassed by ",{"i":"Sprite-Cosmo_Pavone.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:cosmo-pavone"}," ",{"t":"Cosmo","r":"character:cosmo-pavone"},"). This allows him to synergize with a variety of weapons and arcana depending on the focus of their stat bonuses:"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Potentially having the highest scaling ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},", Blackmore can make particularly good use of ",{"t":"SpellStrike","r":"weapon:spellstrike"},"."]},{"c":["Potentially having the highest scaling ",{"i":"Sprite-Area.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:area"}," ",{"t":"Area","r":"powerup:area"},", Blackmore can make particularly good use of ",{"t":"SpellStream","r":"weapon:spellstream"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Santa_Water.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:santa-water"}," ",{"t":"Santa Water","r":"weapon:santa-water"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Lightning_Ring.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:lightning-ring"}," ",{"t":"Lightning Ring","r":"weapon:lightning-ring"},", and so on."]},{"c":["Potentially having the highest scaling ",{"i":"Sprite-Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:speed"}," ",{"t":"Speed","r":"powerup:speed"},", Blackmore can make particularly good use of ",{"t":"SpellString","r":"weapon:spellstring"},", ",{"t":"King Bible","r":"weapon:king-bible"},", ",{"t":"Runetracer","r":"weapon:runetracer"},", and so on."]},{"c":["Potentially having the highest scaling ",{"i":"Sprite-Duration.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:duration"}," ",{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"},", Blackmore can make particularly good use of ",{"t":"Runetracer","r":"weapon:runetracer"},", ",{"t":"Bone","r":"weapon:bone"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-La_Robba.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:la-robba"}," ",{"t":"La Robba","r":"weapon:la-robba"},", and so on."]},{"c":["Potentially having the highest scaling ",{"i":"Sprite-Luck.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},", Blackmore may be able to make good use of ",{"t":"Gatti Amari","r":"weapon:gatti-amari"},", ",{"t":"Muramasa","r":"weapon:muramasa"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-108_Bocce.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:108-bocce"}," ",{"t":"108 Bocce","r":"weapon:108-bocce"},", and so on."]},{"c":["Potentially having the highest scaling ",{"i":"Sprite-Curse.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:curse"}," ",{"t":"Curse","r":"powerup:curse"},", Blackmore can make particularly good use of ",{"i":"Sprite-108_Bocce.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:108-bocce"}," ",{"t":"108 Bocce","r":"weapon:108-bocce"}," and ",{"t":"Twilight Requiem (II)","r":"arcana:twilight-requiem-ii"},"."]},{"c":["Potentially having the highest scaling ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},", Blackmore can make particularly good use of ",{"t":"Shadow Pinion","r":"weapon:shadow-pinion"},", ",{"t":"Vento Sacro","r":"weapon:vento-sacro"},", ",{"t":"Celestial Dusting","r":"weapon:celestial-dusting"},", and so on."]}]}},{"c":["Regardless of build, selecting ",{"i":"Sprite-Growth.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:growth"}," ",{"t":"Growth","r":"powerup:growth"}," for some of Blackmore's bonuses will result in enough additional levels that you will gain more of other stats than if you were to exclusively select another bonus. The value proposition of more Growth bonuses depends on how long you continue your run and how dense with enemies it is."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Blackmore.png","w":96,"h":120,"c":["Blackmore's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Blackmore.gif","w":96,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 31 October 2024 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["The spell \"bizarreshadeadventure\" is a reference to him being inspired by ",{"t":"JoJo's Bizarre Adventure","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure"},"."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Blackmore","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Blackmore"}," on the ",{"t":" Castlevania Wiki","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}